Minimum qualifications:

Bachelor's degree or equivalent practical experience.
5 years of experience in program or project management.
5 years of experience with manufacturing, supply chain management, or fulfillment planning and execution in a New Product Introduction (NPI) role.

Preferred qualifications:

Master's degree or MBA in a business, operation, finance, or technical field, or equivalent practical experience.
5 years of experience managing cross-functional or cross-team projects.
Experience in cost modeling, strategic analysis, and data-driven storytelling using spreadsheets and executive-level presentations.
